# Canonical PBMC cell-type marker programmes, compiled from widely used marker lists
# (e.g. the Seurat/scanpy PBMC 3k tutorials and PanglaoDB). Gene symbols are human (HGNC).
# Format: name <tab> description <tab> genes...
MARKERS_T_CELL	T cell receptor complex and T cell identity	CD3D	CD3E	CD3G	CD2	CD5	CD6	CD7	CD247	LCK	ZAP70	IL7R	LAT	TRAT1
MARKERS_CD8_T_CELL	CD8 T cell co-receptor and identity	CD8A	CD8B	CD3D	CD3E	CRTAM	CD160	KLRK1	GZMK
MARKERS_NK_CYTOTOXIC	NK and cytotoxic lymphocyte effector genes	NKG7	GNLY	GZMA	GZMB	GZMH	PRF1	KLRD1	KLRF1	CST7	FGFBP2	CTSW	SPON2	HOPX
MARKERS_B_CELL	B cell receptor and B cell identity	MS4A1	CD79A	CD79B	CD19	CD22	BANK1	BLK	FCRLA	TCL1A	VPREB3	CD72	FCER2	LINC00926
MARKERS_CLASSICAL_MONOCYTE	CD14+ classical monocytes	CD14	LYZ	S100A8	S100A9	S100A12	VCAN	FCN1	CSF1R	MNDA	CD36	LGALS2	MS4A6A
MARKERS_NONCLASSICAL_MONOCYTE	FCGR3A+ non-classical monocytes	FCGR3A	MS4A7	CDKN1C	LST1	AIF1	IFITM2	RHOC	CX3CR1	HMOX1	LILRB2	TCF7L2
MARKERS_DENDRITIC_CELL	Conventional dendritic cells	FCER1A	CLEC10A	CD1C	CLEC4C	HLA-DQA1	HLA-DQB1	ENHO	PLD4	SERPINF1	LILRA4	IRF8
MARKERS_PLATELET	Platelets and megakaryocytes	PPBP	PF4	GNG11	SDPR	ITGA2B	GP9	TUBB1	CLU	SPARC	TREML1	NRGN	GP1BB
